        <mxCell id="s1-note" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap" value="SECTION 1 DATA FLOW:&#xa;1. Cargo reads Cargo.toml, resolves dependencies from crates.io&#xa;2. rustc compiles each .rs crate → .rlib (Rust library archive)&#xa;3. rustc links all .rlib files → final binary (static linking)&#xa;4. All crate dependencies are statically compiled into binary&#xa;&#xa;Key: Rust has no dynamic linking by default&#xa;All crates are statically linked into the final binary&#xa;&#xa;Rust Build Tools:&#xa;• Cargo — the only orchestrator (build + package manager)&#xa;• rustc — the compiler (invoked by Cargo)&#xa;• No ar/ld — rustc handles linking internally" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="165" width="280" x="597" y="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="div1" parent="1" style="line;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#111111;dashed=1" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="10" width="970" x="40" y="318" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
